          "end": 612,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.010:block:2",
          "start": 360
        },
        "quote": "“Quad axles” means four or more consecutive axles, arranged in tandem and articulated from a common attachment to the vehicle or individually attached to the vehicle, with such axles spaced more than 120 inches apart and not more than 150 inches apart.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
