          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.010:block:3",
          "start": 613
        },
        "quote": "“Tandem axles” means two or more consecutive axles, arranged in tandem and articulated from a common attachment to the vehicle or individually attached to the vehicle, with such axles spaced not less than 40 inches apart and not more than 96 inches apart.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
