        "quote": "“Triple axles” means three or more consecutive axles, arranged in tandem and articulated from a common attachment to the vehicle or individually attached to the vehicle, with such axles spaced more than 96 inches apart and not more than 120 inches apart. (Code 1981 § 43-674. Code 1995 § 142-736.)",
